  ('LBN-LAB-001', '73-76', 'Sécurité et santé au travail', 'fr', 'Lebanese Labour Code, Article 73-76', 'Occupational Safety and Health', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-LAB-001', '73-76', 'السلامة والصحة المهنية', 'ar', 'Lebanese Labour Code, Article 73-76', 'Occupational Safety and Health', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-LAB-001', '83-106', 'Syndicats professionnels', 'fr', 'Lebanese Labour Code, Article 83-106', 'Trade Unions', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-LAB-001', '83-106', 'النقابات العمالية', 'ar', 'Lebanese Labour Code, Article 83-106', 'Trade Unions', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-LAB-001', NULL, 'Enacted on September 23, 1946, shortly after Lebanese independence. Based on French labor law traditions. Has undergone numerous amendments to adapt to changing economic and social conditions. The 2010 amendment (Law 129/2010) was significant for Palestinian refugee workers.', 'en', 'Lebanese Labour Code — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '1-12', 'Organisation administrative et champ d''application', 'fr', 'Social Security Law, Article 1-12', 'Administrative Organization', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '1-12', 'التنظيم الإداري وميدان تطبيق الضمان الاجتماعي', 'ar', 'Social Security Law, Article 1-12', 'Administrative Organization', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '9', 'Catégories bénéficiaires de la sécurité sociale', 'fr', 'Social Security Law, Article 9', 'Beneficiaries', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '9', 'الفئات المستفيدة من الضمان الاجتماعي', 'ar', 'Social Security Law, Article 9', 'Beneficiaries', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '13-63', 'Prestations - allocations familiales, maternité, maladie, fin de service', 'fr', 'Social Security Law, Article 13-63', 'Benefits', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '13-63', 'التقديمات - تعويضات العائلة والامومة والمرض ونهاية الخدمة', 'ar', 'Social Security Law, Article 13-63', 'Benefits', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '68', 'Plafond des rémunérations soumises à cotisations', 'fr', 'Social Security Law, Article 68', 'Contribution Ceiling', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', '68', 'الحد الأقصى للراتح الخاضع للاقتطاعات', 'ar', 'Social Security Law, Article 68', 'Contribution Ceiling', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-SOC-001', NULL, 'Established the National Social Security Fund (CNSS/NSSF) in 1963. Created a social insurance system covering family allowances, sickness and maternity, and end-of-service indemnity. Major reform in December 2023 with Law 319 introducing a pension system to replace the end-of-service indemnity.', 'en', 'Social Security Law — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Social Security'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '1', 'Fixation du salaire minimum par le Conseil des Ministres sur proposition du Ministre du Travail', 'fr', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 1', 'Minimum Wage Setting', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '1', 'تحديد الحد الأدنى للأجور من قبل مجلس الوزراء بناء على اقتراح وزير العمل', 'ar', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 1', 'Minimum Wage Setting', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '2', 'Commission de l''indice des prix - représentants gouvernement, employeurs, travailleurs', 'fr', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 2', 'Price Index Committee', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '2', 'لجنة مؤشر تكلفة المعيشة - ممثلون عن الحكومة وأصحاب العمل والعمال', 'ar', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 2', 'Price Index Committee', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '5-6', 'Publication annuelle de l''indice des prix', 'fr', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 5-6', 'Cost of Living Index', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', '5-6', 'نشر مؤشر تكلفة المعيشة سنويا', 'ar', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing, Article 5-6', 'Cost of Living Index', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-001', NULL, 'Established the legal framework for minimum wage setting in Lebanon. Created the tripartite Price Index Committee (workers, employers, government) to advise on wage adjustments based on cost of living.', 'en', 'Law Concerning Minimum Wage Fixing — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '1', 'Abrogation du Décret 500/2008', 'fr', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 1', 'Repeal', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '1', 'إلغاء أحكام المرسوم 500/2008', 'ar', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 1', 'Repeal', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '2', 'Salaire minimum mensuel 675,000 LLP, journalier 30,000 LLP', 'fr', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 2', 'Minimum Wage Rates', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '2', 'الحد الأدنى للأجر الشهري 675,000 ل.ل واليومي 30,000 ل.ل', 'ar', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 2', 'Minimum Wage Rates', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '3', 'Allocation de vie chère - 100% sur premier 400,000 LLP et 9% sur 400,000-1,500,000 LLP', 'fr', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 3', 'Cost of Living Allowance', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', '3', 'علاوة غلاء المعيشة - 100% على أول 400,000 ل.ل و9% على ما بين 400,000 و1,500,000 ل.ل', 'ar', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance, Article 3', 'Cost of Living Allowance', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-002', NULL, 'Major minimum wage increase from LBP 500,000 to LBP 675,000 monthly. Implemented after extensive negotiations and resignation of Minister of Labor Charbel Nahas who opposed the transportation allowance decree.', 'en', 'Decree Fixing Minimum Wage and Providing Cost of Living Allowance — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-003', '1', 'Allocation coût de vie 600,000 LLP pour salaires mensuels, 28,000 LLP pour salaires journaliers', 'fr', 'Decree Increasing Minimum Wage for Cost of Living Coverage, Article 1', 'Cost of Living Increase', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-003', '1', 'زيادة غلاء المعيشة 600,000 ل.ل للرواتب الشهرية و28,000 ل.ل للأجور اليومية', 'ar', 'Decree Increasing Minimum Wage for Cost of Living Coverage, Article 1', 'Cost of Living Increase', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-003', '2', 'L''augmentation est soumise aux cotisations de sécurité sociale', 'fr', 'Decree Increasing Minimum Wage for Cost of Living Coverage, Article 2', 'Social Security Contributions', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-003', '2', 'الزيادة خاضعة لاقتطاعات الضمان الاجتماعي', 'ar', 'Decree Increasing Minimum Wage for Cost of Living Coverage, Article 2', 'Social Security Contributions', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-003', NULL, 'First major adjustment during economic crisis. Increased minimum wage from LBP 675,000 to LBP 1,275,000 monthly. Response to currency devaluation and hyperinflation.', 'en', 'Decree Increasing Minimum Wage for Cost of Living Coverage — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-004', '1', 'Augmentation de 1,325,000 LLP pour salaires < 4,000,000 LLP/mois', 'fr', 'Decree Amending Decree 7426/2012 on Minimum Monthly Wages, Article 1', 'Wage Increase', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-004', '1', 'زيادة 1,325,000 ل.ل للرواتب أقل من 4,000,000 ل.ل شهريا', 'ar', 'Decree Amending Decree 7426/2012 on Minimum Monthly Wages, Article 1', 'Wage Increase', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-004', '2', 'Augmentation de 61,000 LLP pour salaires journaliers ≤ 182,000 LLP', 'fr', 'Decree Amending Decree 7426/2012 on Minimum Monthly Wages, Article 2', 'Daily Wage Increase', 'Labor Law'),
  ('LBN-MIN-004', '2', 'زيادة 61,000 ل.ل للأجور اليومية غير المتجاوزة 182,000 ل.ل', 'ar', 'Decree Amending Decree 7426/2012 on Minimum Monthly Wages, Article 2', 'Daily Wage Increase', 'Labor Law');
