  ('LBN-MIN-004', NULL, 'Major wage adjustment during economic crisis. New minimum wage set at LBP 2,000,000 monthly. Also increased NSSF ceilings for sickness/maternity and family allowances.', 'en', 'Decree Amending Decree 7426/2012 on Minimum Monthly Wages — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Labor Law'),
