  ('LD-1920-086', NULL, 'French Mandate period - Governor Major Trabaud issued this decree establishing the Directorate of Justice as the core agency of what would become the Ministry of Justice', 'en', 'Decree No. 86 Establishing the Directorate of Justice — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Legislative Decree - Mandate Period'),
