  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '38-50', 'Police judiciaire - Compétences', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 38-50', 'Judicial Police', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '38-50', 'الشرطة القضائية - اختصاصاتها', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 38-50', 'Judicial Police', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '51-127', 'Juge d''instruction - Fonctions et pouvoirs', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 51-127', 'Investigating Judge', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '51-127', 'قاضي التحقيق - وظائفه وصلاحياته', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 51-127', 'Investigating Judge', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '107', 'La détention préventive est l''exception, pas la règle - La liberté en attendant le procès est le principe', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 107', 'Pre-trial detention principle', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '107', 'الحجز الاحتياطي استثناء وليس قاعدة - الحرية أثناء انتظار المحاكمة هي الأصل', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 107', 'Pre-trial detention principle', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '108', 'Durée de la détention préventive - 2 mois pour délits, 6 mois pour crimes', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 108', 'Pre-trial detention duration', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '108', 'مدة الحجز الاحتياطي - شهران للجنح، ستة أشهر للجنايات', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 108', 'Pre-trial detention duration', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '111', 'Alternatives à la détention préventive - Caution et surveillance judiciaire', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 111', 'Alternatives to detention', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '111', 'بدائل الحجز الاحتياطي - الكفالة والإشراف القضائي', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 111', 'Alternatives to detention', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '113', 'Remise de jure en liberté - après 5 jours pour délits', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 113', 'Automatic release', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '113', 'الإخلاء سبيل de jure - بعد خمسة أيام للجنح', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 113', 'Automatic release', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '128-146', 'Chambre d''accusation - Compétences', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 128-146', 'Indictment Chamber', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '128-146', 'غرفة الاتهام - اختصاصاتها', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 128-146', 'Indictment Chamber', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '150-367', 'Tribunaux de jugement - Crimes, délits et contraventions', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 150-367', 'Trial Courts', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '150-367', 'محاكم الحكم - الجنايات والجنح والمخالفات', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 150-367', 'Trial Courts', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '212-213', 'Appel - Admissibilité du recours', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 212-213', 'Appeals', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '212-213', 'الاستئناف - قبول الطعن', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 212-213', 'Appeals', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '400-424', 'Surveillance judiciaire des lieux de détention et prisons', 'fr', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 400-424', 'Judicial supervision of custody', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', '400-424', 'الإشراف القضائي على أماكن الحجز والسجون', 'ar', 'Code of Criminal Procedure, Article 400-424', 'Judicial supervision of custody', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-002', NULL, 'The Code of Criminal Procedure was enacted by Law No. 328 of August 2, 2001, and published in the Official Gazette on August 7, 2001. It replaced the previous Code of Criminal Procedure of 1948 and subsequent amendments. The new Code was a comprehensive reform of criminal procedure in Lebanon, incorporating international standards and human rights principles. It has been amended multiple times to address emerging issues including trafficking in persons.', 'en', 'Code of Criminal Procedure — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Procedure'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '6', 'Tribunal militaire permanent - Composition et compétences', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 6', 'Permanent Military Tribunal', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '6', 'المحكمة العسكرية الدائمة - تشكيلها واختصاصاتها', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 6', 'Permanent Military Tribunal', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '13-14', 'Nomination des juges militaires - Durée de la nomination', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 13-14', 'Appointment of military judges', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '13-14', 'تعيين القضاة العسكريين - مدة التعيين', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 13-14', 'Appointment of military judges', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24', 'Compétence des tribunaux militaires - Crimes militaires et autres crimes', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24', 'Jurisdiction of military courts', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24', 'اختصاص المحاكم العسكرية - الجرائم العسكرية وجرائم أخرى', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24', 'Jurisdiction of military courts', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(1)', 'Crimes militaires - Évasion du service, violation des devoirs et de l''honneur, violation de l''ordre militaire', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(1)', 'Military offenses', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(1)', 'جرائم عسكرية - التهرب من الخدمة، انتهاك الواجبات والشرف، انتهاك النظام العسكري', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(1)', 'Military offenses', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(2)', 'Trahison, espionnage et connexions illégales avec l''ennemi', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(2)', 'Treason and espionage', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(2)', 'الخيانة والتجسس والاتصال غير المشروع بالعدو', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(2)', 'Treason and espionage', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(3)-(4)', 'Crimes liés aux armes et munitions, crimes commis dans les camps et casernes militaires', 'fr', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(3)-(4)', 'Arms and military premises offenses', 'Criminal Law'),
  ('LBN-CRIM-003', '24(3)-(4)', 'جرائم الأسلحة والذخائر، الجرائم المرتكبة في المعسكرات والثكنات العسكرية', 'ar', 'Code of Military Justice, Article 24(3)-(4)', 'Arms and military premises offenses', 'Criminal Law'),
